Z||000010||Oreif||10-17-2000||11:10 AM||||It's one of the many "Hallmark Holidays" Like bosses day, secretary's day, sweetest day, etc. Maybe we should start a Fiero day?<BR>Pick a day and we'll have an excuse to buy something for our fiero's! Actually in 1983 GM and U.S. congressman Bob Carr deemed  September 13th as Fiero day. Maybe we could get Hallmark to actually print up cards!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
